WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.425
Welcome back to Building Azure Security.

2
00:00:02.425 --> 00:00:05.800
This is Chapter 4: the
web application firewall.

3
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.438
A firewall in detection mode
is a log with good intentions.

4
00:00:09.438 --> 00:00:10.835
The check reads the mode,

5
00:00:10.835 --> 00:00:14.326
and the switch to prevention
stays a decision a person makes.

6
00:00:14.326 --> 00:00:18.357
We'll start from what Microsoft Learn
gives you, see what it leaves to you,

7
00:00:18.357 --> 00:00:22.457
read how the kit checks every policy
and every internet-facing endpoint,

8
00:00:22.457 --> 00:00:25.737
and why it writes the switch to
a plan instead of sending it.

9
00:00:25.737 --> 00:00:29.088
Then two labs, the
evidence and the dangers.

10
00:00:29.088 --> 00:00:33.820
The chapter has been reviewed and
approved, and the code is illustrative.
